# Frontend stack

- App lives in `apps/frontend`. Package manager is pnpm.
- React + Vite + TypeScript. TailwindCSS for styling.
- UI only. Domain recovery rules stay in `services/` on the backend.
- Use functional components and TypeScript types for API responses.
- Proxy `/api` to the FastAPI server in Vite config. Do not hardcode production API hosts in components.
